    "sections": {
        "description": "Eduna LMS is an online course and education WordPress theme designed for creating Learning Management Systems and selling eCommerce products. Perfect for school, college, university, content creators, training institutions. Eduna LMS provides a seamless experience for managing courses and selling products with woocommerce. With built-in support for WooCommerce, you can easily sell physical or digital products like books, study materials, or course subscriptions alongside your e-learning platform. Eduna LMS combines a sleek, responsive design with robust functionality to create a one-stop solution for education and eCommerce."
    },
